[330.795755, "o", ">     {\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>         \"qid\": \"fbab4114f66e2dda\",\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[330.795802, "o", "        \"status\": \"ANSWERED\",\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[330.797071, "o", "        \"answer\": \"The important warnings and precautions associated with Paxlovid are: 1) Risk of Serious Adverse Reactions Due to Drug Interactions: Ritonavir is a strong CYP3A inhibitor, and co-administration with CYP3A-metabolized drugs can lead to serious, life-threatening, or fatal events, while strong CYP3A inducers can decrease Paxlovid exposure, causing loss of efficacy and resistance. 2) Hypersensitivity Reactions: Anaphylaxis, serious skin reactions (including toxic epidermal necrolysis and Stevens-Johnson syndrome), and other hypersensitivity reactions have been reported. 3) Hepatotoxicity: Hepatic transaminase elevations, clinical hepatitis, and jaundice have occurred in patients receiving ritonavir. 4) Risk of HIV-1 Resistance Development: Ritonavir co-administration may lead to HIV-1 developing resistance to HIV protease inhibitors in individuals with uncontrolled or undiagnosed HIV-1 infection.\",\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[330.79716, "o", "\u001b[?2004h>         \"citations\": [\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
